  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/d5b5373e520a5efcf5.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"חלק מתוך פאזל - מסמל חידה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"667\" data-original-width=\"688\" height=\"194\" src=\"/assets/images/content/d5b5373e520a5efcf5.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\">גלו את הביטויים מהפרשה (בראשית פרק כ\"ג פסוקים א-י) השזורים בידיעות העיתונאיות הבאות:</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">👈1.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גלובס (יואב קרני 30.09.2025</span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">)</span></span></p><p></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"117\" data-original-width=\"643\" height=\"73\" src=\"/assets/images/content/369abeb7a2c9cb45d0.png\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\" width=\"400\" /></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></td></tr></tbody></table></ol><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">👈2.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">גלובס (דין שמואל אלמס 01/10/2025)</span></span><br /><br /></span></span></p><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/3e19eb719a90650e5c.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"150\" data-original-width=\"820\" height=\"74\" src=\"/assets/images/content/3e19eb719a90650e5c.png\" width=\"400\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2><div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 איבר בגוף האדם<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מדינה באפריקה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 תקופת מעבר אל הזיקנה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 אבי רבקה (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שמו הפרטי של המשורר ישורון\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 רוצה\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 צאצאית</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1. \"וַיִּהְיוּ חַיֵּי שָׂרָה <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">מֵאָה שָׁנָה</span> וְעֶשְׂרִים שָׁנָה וְשֶׁבַע שָׁנִים שְׁנֵי חַיֵּי שָׂרָה\"<br />2. \"וַיְדַבֵּר אִתָּם לֵאמֹר <span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אִם יֵשׁ</span> אֶת נַפְשְׁכֶם לִקְבֹּר אֶת מֵתִי מִלְּפָנַי שְׁמָעוּנִי וּפִגְעוּ לִי בְּעֶפְרוֹן בֶּן <span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\">צֹחַר\"</span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">לב</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">, לוב</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">, בלות</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">, בתואל</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">אבות,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">תאב, בת</span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>"
